What are Piezoelectric MEMS Foundry Services?
Piezoelectric MEMS foundry services provide specialized manufacturing capabilities for micro-scale devices that combine piezoelectric materials with semiconductor processes. These innovative materials enable energy conversion between mechanical and electrical signals, powering applications ranging from precision sensors to energy harvesters. The technology leverages key processes like PZT thin-film deposition and CMOS-compatible fabrication, offering unique advantages in sensitivity and energy efficiency compared to traditional MEMS solutions.
